OL,3,A'Spray and pray': How AI job
OL,4,Aapplications can backfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTom, 22, from Maidstone graduated last
OL,7,Fyear with a geography degree and says
OL,8,Fhe applied for over 200 jobs before
OL,9,Ffinally landing a role last month as a
OL,10,Frestaurant manager.
